{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Is it not פרוש [breaking of bread].</b> Like פורש אין להם (Lamentations 4:4), and similar is פריסת מלכותך (Daniel 5:28), and the meaning is breaking a loaf of bread:" "<b>מרודים [the driven away].</b> The mem is a root letter, and it is like מעונים (1 Chronicles 4:41), and similar is זכור עני ומרודי (Lamentations 3:19):" "<b>תביא בית [you shall bring into the house].</b> Your house." "<b>ומבשרך לא תתעלם [and from your flesh you shall not hide yourself].</b> Like קרוב [kinsman], like אחינו בשרנו הוא (Genesis 37:27):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 58, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:08.453854965Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}